{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069d","title":"黄祖弃城逃走被追擒","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069d-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"将士进攻其城，黄祖闻陈就死弃城逃走，被兵追擒。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069d-q"]},{"id":"wufan-a-052a227e0064caf9b99f","label":"正文","text":"孙权军至即破黄祖，祖夜亡，至五更中果得之","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0033","role":"逃走被擒","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069d-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"领军破祖者","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]},{"person":"wufan-p-8e104caf2e8d33","role":"预言未远必生擒者","evidence":["wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"从征黄祖时","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o069d-q","source_order":[54,317,"O069d"],"order":9682}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wufan-p-8e104caf2e8d33","name":"吴范（术数家）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0033","name":"黄祖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wufan-q-e297cdefd9d420d39248","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b84cf48ba2c7aa9dcf0c","layer":"original","quote":"会孙权起于东南，范委身服事。每有灾祥，辄推数言状；其术多效，遂以显名。初，权在吴，欲讨黄祖。范曰：“今兹少利，不如明年。明年戊子〖4〗，荆州刘表亦身死国亡。”权遂征祖，卒不能克。明年，军出。行及寻阳，范见风气，因诣船贺，催兵急行。至即破祖，祖（得）夜亡〖5〗。权恐失之，范曰：“未远，必生擒祖。”至五更中，果得之。刘表竟死，荆州分割。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069d-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","layer":"original","quote":"将士乘胜，进攻其城。祖闻就死，委城走，兵追擒之。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":57}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
